  "description": "Dynamic One-For-All (DOFA) is a neural plasticity-inspired multimodal foundation model for Earth Observation, capable of adaptively processing data from diverse sensors and modalities (optical, SAR, hyperspectral, etc.) within a single unified Transformer framework using a dynamic hypernetwork conditioned on spectral wavelength.",
